            <history xml:id="history_idcf9a3ed4">
               <p xml:id="idm61">Rosing's song was published anonymously in "Nogle Smaadigte af en Student" (Some Small Poems by A Student) in 1859. Hartmann sat music to four other poems from this collection: "Solnedgang" (HartW 397); "Et Ønske" (HartW 401); "Vaarsang" (HartW 404); and "Vaarsang" (HartW 405).</p>
            </history>
